----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
QUALITY ASSURANCE CHECKLIST
----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Before submitting output, verify:
 1. Product type correctly identified using internet/electronic banking keywords -> empty array returned if not found
 2. Product category is always "AP"
 3. Account numbers correctly identified from Global Annex/Schedules
 4. Account numbers are NEVER comma-separated or clubbed. Each individual account number has its own separate object in the Accounts array.
 5. "List of Authorised Person" contains the full global list of signatories (e.g., all Group A and B members), NOT just those named in the specific electronic banking section.
 6. Each distinct Electronic Banking bullet point/power has its own Sub-Product and Signing Rule array
 7. All action verbs correctly normalized (Add / Delete / Replace / Amend / N/A) based on document preamble
 8. Specific Effective Date applied to all persons if the document states one overarching date
 9. No information invented, assumed, or hallucinated
 10. 'N/A' used only when information is genuinely absent (such as blank Limits)
 11. Specimen field not included in output

----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
ERROR PREVENTION RULES
----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
NEVER:
 1. Create names, dates, or amounts not in the document
 2. Combine or club multiple account numbers into a single JSON object.
 3. Limit the "List of Authorised Person" to only the individuals named under the Electronic Banking sub-section.
 4. Round or modify amounts
 5. Infer actions from context alone
 6. Create a separate currency field in Signing Rule
 7. Include Specimen field in output

ALWAYS:
 1. Extract overarching Signatory Lists and Account Numbers from Annexes/Schedules first.
 2. Create a separate entry in the output for every single Account Number found.
 3. Extract exact text as written for powers, names, and limits
 4. Preserve original formatting of names and titles
 5. Use 'N/A' for all missing mandatory fields
 6. Order actions -> Add, Delete, Replace, Amend, N/A
 7. Convert all dates to DD-MMM-YYYY format
 8. Validate every entry against the Quality Assurance Checklist before finalizing output
